o pigtail.\nConnect ONLY to an isolated, switched 3.3 V media interface; NOT controller R0 J3.\nContacts must be de-energized during movement. Main-board isolation is separate unfinished work.\nHarwin S7131-45R: top-down compression part; sliding wear/snagging still requires bench testing.\nSoldered springs. Replace complete screw-mounted cartridge or desolder individual contact." (at 119.38 129.54 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 1578cfa6-04c0-437f-8279-e71f5b0285dd)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))